the night; duration varies with the night interval."}]},"dian":{"category":"time","han":"點","romanisation":"diǎn","aliases":["dian"],"claims":[{"factor":null,"periods":["tang"],"reference_ids":["TANGLIUDIAN"],"authority":"Zhang, Jiuling 張九齡 et al.","status":"informational","note":"One fifth of a 更, therefore one twenty-fifth of the night."}]},"hour":{"category":"time","han":"小時","romanisation":"xiǎoshí","aliases":["hour","hr","h"],"claims":[{"factor":0.041666666666666664,"periods":["all"],"reference_ids":["BIPM2026"],"authority":"Bureau International des Poids et Mesures","status":"modern"}]},"minute":{"category":"time","han":"分鐘","romanisation":"fēnzhōng","aliases":["minute","min"],"claims":[{"factor":0.0006944444444444445,"periods":["all"],"reference_ids":["BIPM2026"],"authority":"Bureau International des Poids et Mesures","status":"modern"}]},"second":{"category":"time","han":"秒","romanisation":"miǎo","aliases":["second","sec","s"],"claims":[{"factor":1.1574074074074073e-05,"periods":["all"],"reference_ids":["BIPM2026"],"authority":"Bureau International des Poids et Mesures","status":"modern"}]}},"references":{"KROLL2017":{"group":"reference","citation":"Kroll, P. W., Baxter, W. H., Boltz, W. G., Knechtges, D. R., Lien, Y. E., Richter, A., Richter, M. L., & Warner, D. X. (2017). A student’s dictionary of classical and medieval Chinese (S. F. Teiser, M. Kern, & T. Brook, Eds.; revised ed.). Pleco ed. Brill. ISBN 978-90-04-32513-5.","short":"Kroll et al. (2017)","url":null,"quote":null},"HAN_LULI":{"group":"primary","citation":"Ban, Gu 班固 & Ban, Zhao 班昭 (with Ban, Biao 班彪). (n.d.). 漢書, 卷二十一上〈律曆志上〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 1st century CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/han-shu/lv-li-zhi-shang/zh.","short":"Ban, Gu 班固 & Ban, Zhao 班昭, 漢書〈律曆志〉","url":"https://ctext.org/han-shu/lv-li-zhi-shang/zh","quote":"「一龠容千二百黍，重十二銖……二十四銖為兩。十六兩為斤。三十斤為鈞。四鈞為石。」"},"HAN_SHIHUO":{"group":"primary","citation":"Ban, Gu 班固 & Ban, Zhao 班昭 (with Ban, Biao 班彪). (n.d.). 漢書, 〈食貨志〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 1st century CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/han-shu/shi-huo-zhi-xia/zh.","short":"Ban, Gu 班固 & Ban, Zhao 班昭, 漢書〈食貨志〉","url":"https://ctext.org/han-shu/shi-huo-zhi-xia/zh","quote":"「布帛廣二尺二寸為幅，長四丈為匹。」"},"SHUOYUAN":{"group":"primary","citation":"Liu, Xiang 劉向. (n.d.). 說苑, 卷十八〈辨物〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 1st century BCE). Available at: https://ctext.org/shuo-yuan/bian-wu/zh.","short":"Liu, Xiang 劉向, 說苑〈辨物〉","url":"https://ctext.org/shuo-yuan/bian-wu/zh","quote":"「十六黍為一豆，六豆為一銖，二十四銖重一兩……千二百黍為一龠，十龠為一合。」"},"HUAINANZI":{"group":"primary","citation":"Liu, An 劉安 (with Xu, Shen 許慎, commentary in the consulted witness). (n.d.). 淮南子, 〈墬形訓〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 2nd century BCE). Available at: https://ctext.org/huainanzi/di-xing-xun/zh.","short":"Liu, An 劉安 (with Xu, Shen 許慎), 淮南子〈墬形訓〉","url":"https://ctext.org/huainanzi/di-xing-xun/zh","quote":"「里間九純，純丈五尺。」"},"SUNZI":{"group":"primary","citation":"Sunzi 孫子. (n.d.). 孫子算經, 卷上. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 3rd–5th century CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/sunzi-suan-jing/juan-shang/zh.","short":"Sunzi 孫子, 孫子算經","url":"https://ctext.org/sunzi-suan-jing/juan-shang/zh","quote":"「十尺為一丈，十丈為一引；五十尺為一端；四十尺為一疋；六尺為一步。二百四十步為一畝。三百步為一里。」"},"SIKU_SUNZI":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Ji, Yun 紀昀 et al. (n.d.). 四庫全書總目提要, 卷一百七〈孫子算經〉. In Wikisource contributors (Eds.), Wikisource. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 18th century). Available at: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh/四庫全書總目提要/卷107.","short":"Ji, Yun 紀昀 et al., 四庫全書總目提要〈孫子算經〉","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh/四庫全書總目提要/卷107","quote":null},"XIAOERYA_DU":{"group":"primary","citation":"Kong, Fu 孔鮒. (n.d.). 小爾雅, 〈廣度〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://ctext.org/xiao-er-ya/guang-du/zh.","short":"Kong, Fu 孔鮒, 小爾雅〈廣度〉","url":"https://ctext.org/xiao-er-ya/guang-du/zh","quote":"「四尺，謂之仞；倍仞，謂之尋……五尺，謂之墨；倍墨，謂之丈。」"},"XIAOERYA_HENG":{"group":"primary","citation":"Kong, Fu 孔鮒. (n.d.). 小爾雅, 〈廣衡〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://ctext.org/xiao-er-ya/guang-heng.","short":"Kong, Fu 孔鮒, 小爾雅〈廣衡〉","url":"https://ctext.org/xiao-er-ya/guang-heng","quote":"「二十四銖曰兩……十斤曰衡……倍秤曰鈞，四鈞曰石，四石曰鼓。」"},"XIAOERYA_LIANG":{"group":"primary","citation":"Kong, Fu 孔鮒. (n.d.). 小爾雅, 〈廣量〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://ctext.org/xiao-er-ya/guang-liang.","short":"Kong, Fu 孔鮒, 小爾雅〈廣量〉","url":"https://ctext.org/xiao-er-ya/guang-liang","quote":"「一手之盛謂之溢，兩手謂之掬，掬一升也。四掬曰豆，四豆曰區，四區曰釜。」"},"JIUZHANG":{"group":"primary","citation":"九章算術 (with Liu, Hui 劉徽; Li, Chunfeng 李淳風 et al.; Li, Ji 李籍). (n.d.). 方田. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally compiled ca. 1st century BCE–1st century CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/nine-chapters/fang-tian/zh.","short":"九章算術 (with Liu, Hui 劉徽 et al.), 方田","url":"https://ctext.org/nine-chapters/fang-tian/zh","quote":"「廣從步數相乘得積步。以畝法二百四十步除之，即畝數。百畝為一頃。」"},"ZHOU_LI":{"group":"primary","citation":"周禮, 〈考工記〉. (n.d.). In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://ctext.org/rites-of-zhou/kao-gong-ji/zh.","short":"周禮〈考工記〉","url":"https://ctext.org/rites-of-zhou/kao-gong-ji/zh","quote":"「方十里為成。」"},"JINSHU_FUXUAN":{"group":"primary","citation":"Fang, Xuanling 房玄齡 et al. (n.d.). 晉書, 傅玄相關田制議論. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published 648 CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=812652&if=gb.","short":"Fang, Xuanling 房玄齡 et al., 晉書 (preserving Fu, Xuan 傅玄)","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=812652&if=gb","quote":"「古以步百為畝，今以二百四十步為一畝。」"},"TONGDIAN":{"group":"primary","citation":"Du, You 杜佑. (n.d.). 通典, 〈食貨二·田制下〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published 801 CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/text.pl?if=gb&node=552279.","short":"Du, You 杜佑, 通典〈田制下〉","url":"https://ctext.org/text.pl?if=gb&node=552279","quote":"「大唐開元二十五年令：田廣一步、長二百四十步為畝，百畝為頃。」"},"TANGLIUDIAN":{"group":"primary","citation":"Zhang, Jiuling 張九齡 (with Lu, Jian 陸堅; Zhang, Yue 張說; Xiao, Song 蕭嵩; Xu, Jian 徐堅; Wu, Jiong 毋煚; Yu, Qin 余欽; Wei, Shu 韋述; Yuan, Xian 苑咸; Li, Linfu 李林甫, and other commissioned contributors). (n.d.). 唐六典. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally compiled 722–739 CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&res=502694.","short":"Zhang, Jiuling 張九齡 et al., 唐六典","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&res=502694","quote":"「一尺二寸為大尺……三斗為大斗……三兩為大兩。」"},"JIUTANGSHU":{"group":"primary","citation":"Liu, Xu 劉昫 et al. (n.d.). 舊唐書, 〈食貨上〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published 945 CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=956823&if=gb.","short":"Liu, Xu 劉昫 et al., 舊唐書〈食貨上〉","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=956823&if=gb","quote":"「三升為大升，三斗為大斗。」"},"RIZHILU_REN":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Gu, Yanwu 顧炎武. (n.d.). 日知錄, 仞相關考證. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 17th century). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=4583020&if=gb.","short":"Gu, Yanwu 顧炎武, 日知錄 (仞考證)","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=4583020&if=gb","quote":null},"RIZHILU_BAIKE":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Gu, Yanwu 顧炎武. (n.d.). 日知錄, 卷三十〈百刻〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 17th century). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=2891389&if=gb.","short":"Gu, Yanwu 顧炎武, 日知錄〈百刻〉","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=2891389&if=gb","quote":"「一日十二時，計刻則以百刻為日。」"},"DUAN_DU":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Duan, Yucai 段玉裁. (n.d.). 說文解字注, 〈堵〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 19th century). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=524468&if=gb.","short":"Duan, Yucai 段玉裁, 說文解字注〈堵〉","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=524468&if=gb","quote":"「五版為堵……諸說不同……」"},"SHUOWEN":{"group":"primary","citation":"Xu, Shen 許慎. (n.d.). 說文解字. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 2nd century CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/shuo-wen-jie-zi/zh.","short":"Xu, Shen 許慎, 說文解字","url":"https://ctext.org/shuo-wen-jie-zi/zh","quote":null},"ZHU22":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Zhu, Zaiyu 朱載堉. (n.d.). 樂律全書, 卷二十二〈律學新說三·審度篇第一之上〉. In Wikisource contributors (Eds.), Wikisource. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 16th century). Available at: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/樂律全書_(四庫全書本)/卷22.","short":"Zhu, Zaiyu 朱載堉, 樂律全書卷二十二","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/樂律全書_(四庫全書本)/卷22","quote":"「韋昭注曰：六尺為步，半步為武，五尺為墨，倍墨為丈，八尺為尋，倍尋為常。」"},"YU_DADOU":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Yu, Yue 俞樾. (n.d.). 茶香室叢鈔, 〈唐制有大斗大尺〉. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published 1889). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=420135&if=gb. Cheng, Dachang 程大昌, as cited in Yu, Yue 俞樾: 「斗三升為大斗。」","short":"Yu, Yue 俞樾, 茶香室叢鈔〈唐制有大斗大尺〉","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=420135&if=gb","quote":"「宋程大昌《演繁露》云：開元九年敕……量以十升為斗，斗三升為大斗。」"},"ZHU23":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Zhu, Zaiyu 朱載堉. (n.d.). 樂律全書, 卷二十三〈律學新說三·審度篇第一之下〉. In Wikisource contributors (Eds.), Wikisource. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 16th century). Available at: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/樂律全書_(四庫全書本)/卷23.","short":"Zhu, Zaiyu 朱載堉, 樂律全書卷二十三","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/樂律全書_(四庫全書本)/卷23","quote":"「純謂幅廣也，制謂匹長……」"},"ZHU24":{"group":"historical_scholarship","citation":"Zhu, Zaiyu 朱載堉. (n.d.). 樂律全書, 卷二十四〈律學新說四〉. In Wikisource contributors (Eds.), Wikisource. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published ca. 16th century). Available at: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/樂律全書_(四庫全書本)/卷24.","short":"Zhu, Zaiyu 朱載堉, 樂律全書卷二十四","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/樂律全書_(四庫全書本)/卷24","quote":"「度量衡三器之中惟衡最難定……衡出於黍粟者則有燥濕不等……」"},"SONGSHI":{"group":"primary","citation":"Tuo, Tuo 脫脫 et al. (n.d.). 宋史, 相關度里條. In Sturgeon, Donald (Ed.), Chinese Text Project. Retrieved August 18, 2026. (Originally published 1345 CE). Available at: https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=307224&if=gb.","short":"Tuo, Tuo 脫脫 et al., 宋史","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=307224&if=gb","quote":"「古者六尺為步，三百步為里……今以五尺為步，三百六十步為里。」"},"ROC1915":{"group":"statute","citation":"中華民國參政院 (with Yuan, Shikai 袁世凱, promulgation; Xu, Shichang 徐世昌, countersignature). (1915). 權度法. 政府公報 (北洋政府), 第957號. In Wikisource contributors (Eds.), Wikisource. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/權度法.","short":"中華民國參政院, 權度法 (1915)","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/權度法","quote":"「營造尺一尺……百分之三二。庫平一兩……百萬分之三七三〇一。」"},"ROC1929":{"group":"statute","citation":"中華民國國民政府. (1929). 度量衡法. In Wikisource contributors (Eds.), Wikisource. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/度量衡法_(民國18年).","short":"中華民國國民政府, 度量衡法 (1929)","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/度量衡法_(民國18年)","quote":"「市用制長度以公尺三分之一為市尺……重量以公斤二分之一為市斤……容量以公升為市升。」"},"NTU_MEASURE":{"group":"modern_scholarship","citation":"臺大資工數位典藏與自動推論實驗室 (with Chen, Huixian 陳慧先; Xiang, Jie 項潔; Weng, Ji’an 翁稷安; Song, Hao 宋浩; 303實驗室成員). (n.d.). 度量衡單位換算系統. 國立臺灣大學. Retrieved August 18, 2026. Available at: https://thdl.ntu.edu.tw/thd